WEBVTT

00:03:27.871 --> 00:03:30.635
Ngrihuni ne kembe, miqte e mi.

00:03:31.161 --> 00:03:32.193
Ne rregull.

00:03:32.193 --> 00:03:35.001
Mos e filloni mundjen akoma.

00:03:35.001 --> 00:03:37.781
Nese keni nje gisht te lire, tundeni

00:03:37.781 --> 00:03:41.002
dhe siguroheni qe ta lidhni me te tjere.

00:03:41.002 --> 00:03:43.694
OK. Duhet te bejme nje kontroll te minutes se fundit per gishtat.

00:03:43.694 --> 00:03:47.027
Ne qofte se keni nje gisht te lire, tundeni ne ajer qe te siguroheni.

00:03:47.027 --> 00:03:48.520
Kape ate gisht!

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:49.863
Zgjatu prapa. Aty.

00:03:49.863 --> 00:03:51.421
Gishta te tjere?

00:03:51.421 --> 00:03:53.936
Ne rregull, kur te them tre, do filloni.

00:03:53.936 --> 00:03:56.649
Perpiquni te mos mbeteni prapa. Kape, kape, kape.

00:03:56.649 --> 00:03:59.179
Ne rregull? Nje, dy, tre, fillo!

00:03:59.179 --> 00:04:03.268
(Te qeshura)